        {
            "jpName": "ヤエノムテキ",
            "enName": "Yaeno Muteki",
            "jpText": "走り回る子犬……爪を研ぐ子猫……！\r\nくぅ……！",
            "enText": "Puppies running around… kittens sharpening\ntheir claws… <i>Aagh</i>…!",
